{"id":"steam-736290","steam":736290,"igdb":null,"type":"game","title":"Isle of Dinosaurs 2D","summary":"You got teleported into a prehistoric world. It's time to show the inhabiting dinosaurs why you are not extinct and return back home.","about":"Isle of Dinosaurs 2D or simply IOD is a classic action-adventure maze game with pixel art graphics \r\nfeaturing two playable characters, co-op gameplay and dinosaurs.\r\n\r\nYou accidentally teleport into another world by discovering a secret portal\r\nin your grandpa backyard.\r\n\r\nWelcome to IOD, a prehistoric realm that is filled with different\r\ndinosaurs and other mysterious creatures.\r\n\r\n\nKey Features\n\r\n\r\n* 2d pixel art graphics\r\n* top-down view of the world\r\n* warm colors, classic pixel art key-frames animations\r\n* PG-13 friendly story and gameplay (Nintendo like)\r\n* no flashes, no screen shakes, no particles generated in excess\r\n* co-op, shared keyboard or keyboard + controller\r\n* dinosaurs\r\n\r\n\nCharacters\n\r\n\r\nYou can choose between playing a boy or girl:\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nDinosaurs NPCs:\r\n\r\n  - young and elder Anky\r\n\r\n  - young and elder Rex\r\n\r\n  - young and elder Ptery\r\n\r\n* New dinosaurs will be announced after full implementation is ready.\r\n* Initial demo will contain these 3 dinosaurs.\r\n\r\n\nGameplay\n\r\n\r\n* Maps are maze like, you have to collect powerups and items that will help you teleport back home.\r\n* You will face mini-challenges and mini-games.","cover":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/736290/library_600x900.jpg?t=1587543946","coverFallback":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/736290/header.jpg?t=1587543946","banner":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/736290/library_hero.jpg?t=1587543946","header":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/736290/header.jpg?t=1587543946","background":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/